# The same conversation in every theme, switched live.
#
# What it is for: a palette change is only reviewable next to the thing it replaces, and a
# theme that reads well on a desktop monitor can be unreadable on a 3.2" panel in daylight.
# Each `theme` line re-renders the screen already on show, so the strip is one screen, four
# looks, with nothing else moving.
scene demo
scale 4
delay 900

key a
hold 600
theme light
hold 900
theme contrast
hold 900
theme colorblind
hold 900
theme dark
hold 900
